					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><table>
<tbody><tr>
<td style="padding-left: 8px; font-size: 2.75em; font-variant: small-caps"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/b/bb/Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png/325px-Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="325" height="93" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/b/bb/Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png/488px-Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png 1.5x, https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/b/bb/Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png/650px-Wikizilla_MV_wordmark_red.png 2x" data-file-width="1920" data-file-height="548" /></span></span>
</td>
<td style="padding-right: 8px; align: right; text-align: right; padding-right: 8px;">
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding-left: 8px; font-size: 0.95em;"><b>The encyclopedia of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(franchise)" title="Godzilla (franchise)">Godzilla</a></i>, <i><a href="/wiki/Gamera_(franchise)" title="Gamera (franchise)">Gamera</a></i>, <i><a href="/wiki/King_Kong_(franchise)" title="King Kong (franchise)">King Kong</a></i>, and <a href="/wiki/Wikizilla:Scope" title="Wikizilla:Scope">related works</a> that <a href="/wiki/Help:Editing" title="Help:Editing">anyone can contribute to</a>!</b>
</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<hr />
<center><a href="/wiki/Special:WikiForum" title="Special:WikiForum">Forum</a> - <a href="/wiki/Special:RecentChanges" title="Special:RecentChanges">Recent Changes</a> - <a href="/wiki/Special:Categories" title="Special:Categories">Categories</a> - <a href="/wiki/Special:NewPages" title="Special:NewPages">New Pages</a> - <a href="/wiki/Special:WantedPages" title="Special:WantedPages">Wanted Pages</a> - <a href="/wiki/Help:Sandboxes/List" title="Help:Sandboxes/List">Unpublished, In-Progress Pages</a> - <a href="/wiki/Wikizilla:Staff" title="Wikizilla:Staff">Staff</a> - <a href="/wiki/Special:ListUsers" title="Special:ListUsers">Users</a> - <a href="/wiki/Help" title="Help">Help</a></center>
<hr />
<div class="mainleft lightlightgraybg roundy">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="5" style="background:none; border-collapse:separate">
<tbody><tr>
<td width="67%" style="padding:10px; margin:1em 0em 0 -1em; -moz-border-radius:20px 20px 20px 20px; -webkit-border-radius:20px 20px 20px 20px; border-radius:20px 20px 20px 20px; border: 2px solid lightgray; -moz-box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 1em lightgray; -webkit-box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 1em lightgray; box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 1em lightgray; vertical-align:top;"><div class="lightlightgraybg">
<p>Welcome to <b><a href="/wiki/Wikizilla" title="Wikizilla">Wikizilla</a></b>, the Godzilla encyclopedia! We are <a href="/wiki/Special:RecentChanges" title="Special:RecentChanges">currently working</a> on <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://wikizilla.org/wiki/Special:AllPages?hideredirects=1">over 6,000</a> articles and we welcome your contributions. You can check out the <a href="/wiki/Special:NewPages" title="Special:NewPages">new pages</a>, <a href="/wiki/Special:RecentChanges" title="Special:RecentChanges">recent changes</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Special:Statistics" title="Special:Statistics">statistics</a>.
</p><p>Need help? Please visit our <a href="/wiki/Help" title="Help">Help</a> section. Questions? If you've got questions you can ask any administrator, post them in the <a href="/wiki/Talk:Main_Page" title="Talk:Main Page">main page discussion</a>, or you can simply visit our <a href="/wiki/Special:WikiForum" title="Special:WikiForum">forum</a> and ask there. If you need edit-specific help, check out our <a href="/wiki/Help:Editing" title="Help:Editing">editing help page</a>.
</p><p>If you're a new user, check out our <a href="/wiki/Help:New_User_Guide" title="Help:New User Guide">New User Guide</a>! 
</p>
Have fun, and we hope to see you around! </div>
