<div class="mp roundy" style="width:auto; margin-bottom:5px;"><big><big><center><span style="color:white; text-shadow: 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black"><span class="wz-colored-text" style="--text-color:white"><span class="wz-colored-text" style="--text-color:white">Featured Article</span></span></span></center></big></big></div>
<div class="lightgraybg" style="width:auto; margin:10px;">
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/List_of_Godzilla_film_continuities" title="List of Godzilla film continuities"><img src="https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/4/42/New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg/200px-New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="200" height="156" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/4/42/New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg/300px-New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg 1.5x, https://wikizilla-images.s3.us-east-va.perf.cloud.ovh.us/thumb/4/42/New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg/400px-New_Godzilla_Walker_Page_47_-_The_Godzilla_Timeline.jpg 2x" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="779" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>This is a <b>list of the various continuities of the <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(franchise)" title="Godzilla (franchise)">Godzilla</a></i> films</b>, along with other official media that is confirmed to take place within them, arranged in the order in which they chronologically take place. 
</p><p><big><a href="/wiki/List_of_Godzilla_film_continuities" title="List of Godzilla film continuities"><b>Read more&#160;»</b></a></big>
</p>
