<div class="mp roundy" style="width:auto"><big><big><center><span style="color:white; text-shadow: 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black, 0 0 0.2em black"><span class="wz-colored-text" style="--text-color:white">In the News</span></span></center></big></big></div>
<div class="lightgraybg"><center>Today is August 27, <a href="/wiki/2026" title="2026">2026</a>.</center></div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; margin-bottom:3px; margin-top:3px; margin-left:3px;"><tbody><tr><td style="background:transparent;"><div class="lightgraybg skip-responsive" style="overflow:auto; height:200px; max-height:370px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0em; background:transparent;">
<p><small>
</small></p><small>
<ul><li>[8/26/26] <a href="/wiki/Peter_Cullen" title="Peter Cullen">Peter Cullen</a>, the longtime voice actor of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Optimus_Prime" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:Optimus Prime">Optimus Prime</a>, as well as the voice of <a href="/wiki/King_Kong_(De_Laurentiis)" title="King Kong (De Laurentiis)">King Kong</a> in the <a href="/wiki/1976" title="1976">1976</a> <i><a href="/wiki/King_Kong_(1976_film)" title="King Kong (1976 film)">King Kong</a></i> remake and <a href="/wiki/King_Kong_Lives" title="King Kong Lives">its sequel</a>, dies at 85. <a href="/wiki/Toho" title="Toho">Toho</a> releases a behind-the-scenes video for <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Minus_Zero" title="Godzilla Minus Zero">Godzilla Minus Zero</a></i>. <a href="/wiki/Marvel_Comics" title="Marvel Comics">Marvel Comics</a> publishes <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Conquers_the_Multiverse_issue_2" title="Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse issue 2"><i>Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse</i> #2</a>. Gameplay showcasing the full roster of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Destroy_All_Monsters_Melee_Remastered" title="Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered">Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered</a></i> is revealed, with a Steam demo dated for October 15. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/peter-cullen-optimus-prime-transformers-eeyore-1236683075/">src</a>) (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://youtu.be/j4dMnAPZu70">src</a>) (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.ign.com/videos/godzilla-destroy-all-monsters-melee-remastered-roster-demo-reveal-trailer-gamescom-2026">src</a>)</li>
<li>[8/19/26] <a href="/wiki/TOHO_Visual_Entertainment" title="TOHO Visual Entertainment">TOHO Visual Entertainment</a> releases <i><a href="/wiki/Rodan_(film)" title="Rodan (film)">Rodan</a></i>, <i><a href="/wiki/Gorath_(film)" title="Gorath (film)">Gorath</a></i>, and <i><a href="/wiki/Atragon" title="Atragon">Atragon</a></i> on 4K Ultra HD and Blu-ray in Japan.</li>
<li>[8/18/26] <a href="/wiki/McDonald%27s" title="McDonald&#39;s">McDonald's</a> begins its Hello Kitty and Friends x Godzilla Happy Meal promotion.</li>
<li>[8/14/26] The death of R.J. Kizer, director of the original footage shot for <i><a href="/wiki/The_Return_of_Godzilla" title="The Return of Godzilla">Godzilla 1985</a></i>, is reported. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://sidelongglancesofapigeonkicker.blogspot.com/2026/08/r-j-kizer-director-of-american-version.html">src</a>)</li>
<li>[8/12/26] <a href="/wiki/IDW_Publishing" title="IDW Publishing">IDW Publishing</a> releases <i><a href="/wiki/Roar_of_the_Worlds" title="Roar of the Worlds">Roar of the Worlds</a></i>, the third issue of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla%27s_Monsterpiece_Theatre_Presents" title="Godzilla&#39;s Monsterpiece Theatre Presents">Godzilla's Monsterpiece Theatre Presents</a></i>.</li>
<li>[8/4/26] <i>Godzilla Minus Zero</i> will hold its world premiere at the New York Film Festival on September 26. Its 135-minute runtime will make it the longest Japanese-produced <i>Godzilla</i> film. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.filmlinc.org/nyff2026/films/godzilla-minus-zero/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[7/29/26] IDW Publishing releases the <a href="/wiki/The_Horror_of_Godzilla_issue_1" title="The Horror of Godzilla issue 1">first issue</a> of <i><a href="/wiki/The_Horror_of_Godzilla" title="The Horror of Godzilla">The Horror of Godzilla</a></i>.</li>
<li>[7/24/26] The 4D amusement park ride <i><a href="/wiki/Kong_x_Godzilla:_The_Ride" title="Kong x Godzilla: The Ride">Kong x Godzilla: The Ride</a></i> opens in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lotte_World" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:Lotte World">Lotte World</a>.</li>
<li>[7/22/26] IDW Publishing releases <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_vs._America:_San_Diego" title="Godzilla vs. America: San Diego">Godzilla vs. America: San Diego</a></i>. Marvel Comics publishes the <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Conquers_the_Multiverse_issue_1" title="Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse issue 1">first issue</a> of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Conquers_the_Multiverse" title="Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse">Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse</a></i>.</li>
<li>[7/21/26] <a href="/wiki/Kaylee_Hottle" title="Kaylee Hottle">Kaylee Hottle</a>, who played <a href="/wiki/Jia_Andrews" title="Jia Andrews">Jia Andrews</a> in <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_vs._Kong" title="Godzilla vs. Kong">Godzilla vs. Kong</a></i> and <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_x_Kong:_The_New_Empire" title="Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire">Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire</a></i>, dies at 18. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/timlammers/2026/07/21/kaylee-hottle-godzilla-vs-kong-actress-dies-at-18/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[7/15/26] TOHO Visual Entertainment releases <i><a href="/wiki/The_Mysterians" title="The Mysterians">The Mysterians</a></i> and <i><a href="/wiki/Mothra_(film)" title="Mothra (film)">Mothra</a></i> on 4K Ultra HD and Blu-ray in Japan. IDW Publishing releases the <a href="/wiki/Sonic_the_Hedgehog_X_Godzilla_issue_1" title="Sonic the Hedgehog X Godzilla issue 1">first issue</a> of <i><a href="/wiki/Sonic_the_Hedgehog_X_Godzilla" title="Sonic the Hedgehog X Godzilla">Sonic the Hedgehog X Godzilla</a></i>.</li>
<li>[7/13/26] Actor <a href="/wiki/Sam_Neill" title="Sam Neill">Sam Neill</a>, star of the <i><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurassic_Park_(franchise)" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:Jurassic Park (franchise)">Jurassic Park</a></i> films and the upcoming <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_x_Kong:_Supernova" title="Godzilla x Kong: Supernova">Godzilla x Kong: Supernova</a></i>, dies at 78. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://variety.com/2026/film/obituaries-people-news/sam-neill-dead-jurassic-park-1236809330/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[7/9/26] Toho releases a new teaser and poster for <i>Godzilla Minus Zero</i> and confirms returning cast members <a href="/wiki/Hidetaka_Yoshioka" title="Hidetaka Yoshioka">Hidetaka Yoshioka</a>, <a href="/wiki/Yuki_Yamada" title="Yuki Yamada">Yuki Yamada</a>, <a href="/wiki/Kuranosuke_Sasaki" title="Kuranosuke Sasaki">Kuranosuke Sasaki</a>, <a href="/wiki/Sakura_Ando" title="Sakura Ando">Sakura Ando</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Miou_Tanaka" class="mw-redirect" title="Miou Tanaka">Miou Tanaka</a>, as well as newcomer Min Tanaka as biologist Kanji Murakami. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://godzilla.com/blogs/news/new-teaser-and-additional-cast-announced-for-godzilla-minus-zero">src</a>)</li>
<li>[7/2/26] <a href="/wiki/Netflix" title="Netflix">Netflix</a> releases <i><a href="/wiki/Human_Vapor_(series)" title="Human Vapor (series)">Human Vapor</a></i> worldwide.</li>
<li>[7/1/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_12" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 12"><i>Godzilla</i> #12</a>, concluding its second story arc.</li>
<li>[6/23/26] Insight Editions publishes <i><a href="/wiki/The_Monarch_Files:_A_Monsterverse_Manual" title="The Monarch Files: A Monsterverse Manual">The Monarch Files: A Monsterverse Manual</a></i> in the United States.</li>
<li>[6/11/26] MINTROCKET announces the mobile game <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Defense_Force:_X" title="Godzilla Defense Force: X">Godzilla Defense Force: X</a></i>, a follow-up to 2019's <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Defense_Force" title="Godzilla Defense Force">Godzilla Defense Force</a></i> which will be soft-launched for testing in late 2026 and released worldwide in early 2027. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.ign.com/videos/godzilla-defense-force-x-official-reveal-trailer">src</a>)</li>
<li>[6/10/26] IDW Publishing releases <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla%27s_The_Odyssey" title="Godzilla&#39;s The Odyssey">Godzilla's The Odyssey</a></i>, the second issue of <i>Godzilla's Monsterpiece Theatre Presents</i>.</li>
<li>[6/6/26] <a href="/wiki/Atari" title="Atari">Atari</a> announces a <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Destroy_All_Monsters_Melee_Remastered" title="Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered">remaster</a> of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Destroy_All_Monsters_Melee" title="Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee">Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee</a></i> for the Switch 2, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series, and PC, to be released on November 3, 2026. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.gematsu.com/2026/06/godzilla-destroy-all-monsters-melee-remastered-announced-for-ps5-xbox-series-switch-2-and-pc">src</a>)</li>
<li>[6/3/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_11" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 11"><i>Godzilla</i> #11</a>. Marvel Comics releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar_issue_5" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar issue 5"><i>Godzilla: Infinity Roar</i> #5</a>, the final issue in the series.</li>
<li>[5/27/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/The_Rocketeer:_The_Island_issue_3" title="The Rocketeer: The Island issue 3"><i>The Rocketeer: The Island</i> #3</a>. <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Battle_Line" title="Godzilla Battle Line">Godzilla Battle Line</a></i> reveals its first GODZILLA RE:BOOT MOONSTERS, Biollante Harvest and Destoroyah (Super Dragon Form). (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://x.com/Gz_battleline/status/2059603439819375008">src</a>)</li>
<li>[5/26/26] Toho announces that <a href="/wiki/Monster_X" title="Monster X">Monster X</a> will be <a href="/wiki/Godzilla" title="Godzilla">Godzilla</a>'s opponent in <i><a href="/wiki/Fest_Godzilla_II:_Tokyo_Vanishing" title="Fest Godzilla II: Tokyo Vanishing">Fest Godzilla II: Tokyo Vanishing</a></i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://camp-fire.jp/projects/940720/idea">src</a>)</li>
<li>[5/20/26] <a href="/wiki/Titan_Publishing_Group" title="Titan Publishing Group">Titan Comics</a> and <a href="/wiki/Legendary_Comics" title="Legendary Comics">Legendary Comics</a> release <a href="/wiki/Escape_from_Skull_Island_issue_4" title="Escape from Skull Island issue 4"><i>Escape from Skull Island</i> #4</a>, concluding the series.</li>
<li>[5/13/26] IDW Publishing releases <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_vs._America:_Texas" title="Godzilla vs. America: Texas">Godzilla vs. America: Texas</a></i>. McFarland opens preorders for <i><a href="/w/index.php?title=Scoring_Godzilla:_An_Analysis_of_Akira_Ifukube%27s_Musical_Narratives&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Scoring Godzilla: An Analysis of Akira Ifukube&#39;s Musical Narratives (page does not exist)">Scoring Godzilla: An Analysis of Akira Ifukube's Musical Narratives</a></i> by Erik Homenick, the first English book on <a href="/wiki/Akira_Ifukube" title="Akira Ifukube">Akira Ifukube</a>. Legendary Comics launches a Kickstarter campaign for <i><a href="/w/index.php?title=Godzilla_x_Kong:_The_Art_of_Monsterverse_Comics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Godzilla x Kong: The Art of Monsterverse Comics (page does not exist)">Godzilla x Kong: The Art of Monsterverse Comics</a></i>, in the process confirming a graphic novel tie-in for <i>Godzilla x Kong: Supernova</i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.tohokingdom.com/blog/announcing-the-first-english-language-book-on-akira-ifukube/">src</a>) (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/legendarycomics/godzilla-x-kong-the-art-of-monsterverse-comics">src</a>)</li>
<li>[5/12/26] Netflix releases a trailer for <i><a href="/wiki/Human_Vapor_(series)" title="Human Vapor (series)">Human Vapor</a></i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://bloody-disgusting.com/tv/3951194/human-vapor-teaser-trailer-netflix-series-reboots-1960-toho-film-from-director-ishiro-honda/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[5/6/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_10" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 10"><i>Godzilla</i> #10</a>, while Marvel Comics releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar_issue_4" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar issue 4"><i>Godzilla: Infinity Roar</i> #4</a>.</li>
<li>[5/1/26] Apple TV airs the <a href="/wiki/Where_We_Belong" title="Where We Belong">tenth and final episode</a> of <i><a href="/wiki/Monarch:_Legacy_of_Monsters" title="Monarch: Legacy of Monsters">Monarch: Legacy of Monsters</a></i>' second season.</li>
<li>[4/23/26] TOHO Visual Entertainment announces 4K Ultra HD releases for <i>The Mysterians</i> and <i>Mothra</i> on July 15, with <i>Rodan</i>, <i>Gorath</i>, and <i>Atragon</i> to follow on August 19. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.toho.co.jp/dvd">src</a>)</li>
<li>[4/22/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/The_Rocketeer:_The_Island_issue_2" title="The Rocketeer: The Island issue 2"><i>The Rocketeer: The Island</i> #2</a>. Marvel Comics announces <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Conquers_the_Multiverse" title="Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse">Godzilla Conquers the Multiverse</a></i>, a miniseries which will conclude the story of <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Destroys_the_Marvel_Universe" title="Godzilla Destroys the Marvel Universe">Godzilla Destroys the Marvel Universe</a></i> and <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar">Godzilla: Infinity Roar</a></i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://godzilla.com/blogs/news/godzilla-conquers-the-multiverse-brings-the-king-of-the-monsters-to-marvel-s-infinite-realities">src</a>)</li>
<li>[4/15/26] Marvel Comics publishes <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar_issue_3" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar issue 3"><i>Godzilla: Infinity Roar</i> #3</a>, while Titan Comics and Legendary Comics release <a href="/wiki/Escape_from_Skull_Island_issue_3" title="Escape from Skull Island issue 3"><i>Escape from Skull Island</i> #3</a>.</li>
<li>[4/14/26] <a href="/wiki/GKIDS" title="GKIDS">GKIDS</a> screens a teaser and behind-the-scenes footage for <i>Godzilla Minus Zero</i> at CinemaCon, with Toho posting the teaser online later in the day. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://variety.com/2026/film/news/godzilla-minus-zero-trailer-new-york-1236712354/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[4/8/26] IDW Publishing releases <i><a href="/wiki/Romeo_%26_Juliet_and_Godzilla" title="Romeo &amp; Juliet and Godzilla">Romeo &amp; Juliet and Godzilla</a></i>, the first issue of its <i>Godzilla's Monsterpiece Theatre Presents</i> series.</li>
<li>[4/2/26] Bloomsbury Academic publishes the second edition of <i><a href="/wiki/King_Kong:_The_History_of_a_Movie_Icon" title="King Kong: The History of a Movie Icon">King Kong: The History of a Movie Icon</a></i>.</li>
<li>[4/1/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_9" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 9"><i>Godzilla</i> #9</a> and <a href="/wiki/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_x_Godzilla_issue_5" title="Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla issue 5"><i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla</i> #5</a>.</li>
<li>[3/25/26] Marvel Comics publishes <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar_issue_2" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar issue 2"><i>Godzilla: Infinity Roar</i> #2</a>.</li>
<li>[3/23/26] The official <a href="/wiki/Chibi_Godzilla" title="Chibi Godzilla">Chibi Godzilla</a> X account releases a new poster for the second half of season 3 of <i><a href="/wiki/Chibi_Godzilla_Raids_Again" title="Chibi Godzilla Raids Again">Chibi Godzilla Raids Again</a></i>, and reveals a new character set to appear in the show: <a href="/wiki/Chibi_Battra" title="Chibi Battra">Chibi Battra</a>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://x.com/chibigodzi/status/2035990682771337484">src</a>)</li>
<li>[3/18/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Starship_Godzilla_issue_6" title="Starship Godzilla issue 6"><i>Starship Godzilla</i> #6</a>, concluding the series. The final page teases a sequel series, <i><a href="/wiki/Starship_Godzilla:_Invasion_X" title="Starship Godzilla: Invasion X">Starship Godzilla: Invasion X</a></i>.</li>
<li>[3/11/26] IDW Publishing releases <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_vs._America:_Portland" title="Godzilla vs. America: Portland">Godzilla vs. America: Portland</a></i>, while Titan Comics and Legendary Comics publish the print version of <a href="/wiki/Escape_from_Skull_Island_issue_2" title="Escape from Skull Island issue 2"><i>Escape from Skull Island</i> #2</a>.</li>
<li>[3/6/26] <a href="/wiki/Toho_International" title="Toho International">Toho International</a> releases the short film <i><a href="/wiki/Is_Your_Godzilla_Collection_Stop-Motion_Ready%3F" title="Is Your Godzilla Collection Stop-Motion Ready?">Is Your Godzilla Collection Stop-Motion Ready?</a></i> on the GODZILLA OFFICIAL by TOHO YouTube channel and other social media platforms.</li>
<li>[3/4/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_8" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 8"><i>Godzilla</i> #8</a> and <a href="/wiki/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_x_Godzilla_issue_4" title="Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla issue 4"><i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla</i> #4</a>. Titan Comics and Legendary Comics publish <i>Escape from Skull Island</i> #2 digitally.</li>
<li>[3/3/26] The Kickstarter campaign for <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_The_Roleplaying_Game" title="Godzilla: The Roleplaying Game">Godzilla: The Roleplaying Game</a></i> launches. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/idwgames/godzilla-the-roleplaying-game">src</a>)</li>
<li>[2/27/26] Apple TV airs the season 2 premiere of <i>Monarch: Legacy of Monsters</i>, "<a href="/wiki/Cause_and_Effect" title="Cause and Effect">Cause and Effect</a>".</li>
<li>[2/25/26] <a href="/w/index.php?title=DC_Comics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="DC Comics (page does not exist)">DC Comics</a> and Legendary Comics publish <a href="/wiki/Justice_League_vs._Godzilla_vs._Kong_2_issue_7" title="Justice League vs. Godzilla vs. Kong 2 issue 7"><i>Justice League vs. Godzilla vs. Kong 2</i> #7</a>, concluding the series, and IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/The_Rocketeer:_The_Island_issue_1" title="The Rocketeer: The Island issue 1"><i>The Rocketeer: The Island</i> #1</a>.</li>
<li>[2/23/26] IDW Publishing announces the crossover miniseries <i>Sonic the Hedgehog X Godzilla</i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.ign.com/articles/team-sonic-faces-its-biggest-threat-ever-in-sonic-the-hedgehog-x-godzilla-crossover">src</a>)</li>
<li>[2/18/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Starship_Godzilla_issue_5" title="Starship Godzilla issue 5"><i>Starship Godzilla</i> #5</a>.</li>
<li>[2/16/26] IDW Publishing announces <i><a href="/wiki/The_Horror_of_Godzilla" title="The Horror of Godzilla">The Horror of Godzilla</a></i>, a prequel series set in the <a href="/wiki/Kai-Sei_Era" title="Kai-Sei Era">Kai-Sei Era</a>, and confirms that <a href="/wiki/King_Kong" title="King Kong">King Kong</a> will appear in its upcoming miniseries <i><a href="/wiki/The_Rocketeer:_The_Island" title="The Rocketeer: The Island">The Rocketeer: The Island</a></i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://bloody-disgusting.com/exclusives/3935939/the-horror-of-godzilla-comic-will-unleash-godzillas-first-attack-exclusive/">src</a>) (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.comicsbeat.com/exclusive-the-rocketeer-kong-reveal/">src</a>)</li>
<li>[2/11/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Escape_the_Deadzone_issue_6" title="Godzilla: Escape the Deadzone issue 6"><i>Godzilla: Escape the Deadzone</i> #6</a>, concluding the series. The final page teases a sequel series, <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Revenge_of_the_Deadzone" title="Godzilla: Revenge of the Deadzone">Godzilla: Revenge of the Deadzone</a></i>.</li>
<li>[2/4/26] Marvel Comics releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla:_Infinity_Roar_issue_1" title="Godzilla: Infinity Roar issue 1"><i>Godzilla: Infinity Roar</i> #1</a>. IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_7" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 7"><i>Godzilla</i> #7</a> and <a href="/wiki/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_x_Godzilla_issue_3" title="Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla issue 3"><i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla</i> #3</a>.</li>
<li>[2/1/26] <a href="/wiki/SRS_Cinema" title="SRS Cinema">SRS Cinema</a> opens preorders for its Blu-ray release of the documentary <i><a href="/w/index.php?title=Ishiro_Honda:_Memoirs_of_a_Film_Director&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Ishiro Honda: Memoirs of a Film Director (page does not exist)">Ishiro Honda: Memoirs of a Film Director</a></i>.</li>
<li>[1/28/26] <a href="/wiki/Titan_Publishing_Group" title="Titan Publishing Group">Titan Comics</a> and <a href="/wiki/Legendary_Comics" title="Legendary Comics">Legendary Comics</a> release <a href="/wiki/Escape_from_Skull_Island_issue_1" title="Escape from Skull Island issue 1"><i>Escape from Skull Island</i> #1</a>. <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_Battle_Line" title="Godzilla Battle Line">Godzilla Battle Line</a></i> announces that <a href="/wiki/Zilla" title="Zilla">Zilla</a> will be joining its roster, the character's first appearance in any form of media in nearly a decade. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://x.com/Gz_battleline/status/2016436082758594742">src</a>)</li>
<li>[1/27/26] <a href="/wiki/Netflix" title="Netflix">Netflix</a> releases cast photos, a synopsis, and footage for <i>Human Vapor</i>. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://about.netflix.com/en/news/next-on-netflix-japan-2026">src</a>)</li>
<li>[1/23/26] Extreme Film releases <i><a href="/wiki/Kaiju_Heaven" title="Kaiju Heaven">Kaiju Heaven</a></i> to Japanese theaters.</li>
<li>[1/21/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Starship_Godzilla_issue_4" title="Starship Godzilla issue 4"><i>Starship Godzilla</i> #4</a>. <i><a href="/wiki/Sonic_Rumble" title="Sonic Rumble">Sonic Rumble</a></i>'s <i>Godzilla</i> collaboration ends.</li>
<li>[1/15/26] IDW Publishing announces <i>Godzilla's Monsterpiece Theatre Presents</i>, a four-issue series of oversized one-shot comics placing Godzilla into works of classic literature. The first issue, <i>Romeo &amp; Juliet and Godzilla</i>, will release on April 8. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://godzilla.com/blogs/news/godzilla-s-monsterpiece-theatre-presents-launches-in-april-with-romeo-juliet-godzilla">src</a>)</li>
<li>[1/13/26] University of Minnesota Press publishes Jeffrey Angles's English translation of <i><a href="/wiki/The_Luminous_Fairies_and_Mothra" title="The Luminous Fairies and Mothra">The Luminous Fairies and Mothra</a></i>. Apple TV releases a trailer for season 2 of <i>Monarch: Legacy of Monsters</i>, revealing <a href="/wiki/Titan_X" title="Titan X">Titan X</a>.</li>
<li>[1/9/26] Toho announces that the next <i><a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(franchise)" title="Godzilla (franchise)">Godzilla</a></i> film, <i>Godzilla Minus Zero</i>, will be released in Japan on November 3 and in North America on November 6. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://godzilla.com/blogs/news/godzilla-minus-zero-confirmed-for-north-american-theatrical-release-on-november-6">src</a>)</li>
<li>[1/7/26] IDW Publishing releases <a href="/wiki/Godzilla_(2025_comic)_issue_6" title="Godzilla (2025 comic) issue 6"><i>Godzilla</i> #6</a> and <a href="/wiki/Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_x_Godzilla_issue_2" title="Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla issue 2"><i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles x Godzilla</i> #2</a>.</li>
<li>[1/2/26] SRS Cinema opens preorders for its Blu-ray release of <i><a href="/wiki/Brush_of_the_God" title="Brush of the God">Brush of the God</a></i>, slated for April or May. (<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://srscinemastore.com/products/brush-of-the-god-blu-ray">src</a>)</li></ul>
</small><p><small></small>
<b><a href="/wiki/Template:News/Archive" title="Template:News/Archive">► News archive</a></b>
</p>
</div></td><td style="width:5px;"></td></tr></tbody></table>
